      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for saying that. but even knowing it's valid, it doesn't change the fact that the world just feels hollow. it’s like there was this one light in my life and now it's just dark. i look at everything around me and it all feels so meaningless. i just feel like i'm existing in a vacuum. is it even worth it? to just keep going through the motions of a life that feels this empty?",
